{"id":"34211735","title":"小长假走了，“国庆花”还在 | 今日寒露","published_at":"2026-10-08T08:05:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-08","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBxUic9zyibialdZC2dq3mZibuUUumuOBjuI8X43IhuOfFRIZUmKK3thAOSYrswibicibZjmHdc41w5qbNLeP8X5R1VId1GYCqJCia1c64/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"华农二十四节气 【编者按】寒露已至，暑尽风清。岭南褪去盛夏的燥热，秋意随风，吹到每个人的心间。 华农校园内，栾树黄花簌簌、粉果垂枝；大叶相思缀起细碎绒花，镰叶迎","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oPyL0Fozk5TfNnadAZmynA","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34211735","word_count":1956,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T00:22:54+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4480476665726320640#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDlQXkaqloDV7ZqiaVBON2vqMCUo4eY0icmt1BTtF59ic3OZhpF1AW9BicNNXJEFrSXScPLe1Zo7xk281zfx1QoKl5AZPKpHSDBwiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Fr0lUzicdOxfepxtcPXV3REoQbcek9mz23QvnibmsfV2dzGnr5nI0MfAib6aAOpF0ehg9b7TgWibI8OA/640?wx_fmt=png/format,webp\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华农二十四节气</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>【编者按】寒露已至，暑尽风清。岭南褪去盛夏的燥热，秋意随风，吹到每个人的心间。</span></p><p><span>华农校园内，栾树黄花簌簌、粉果垂枝；大叶相思缀起细碎绒花，镰叶迎风舒展；茶园清芬漫溢，秋茶正当采撷。今天，带你走进《华农二十四节气》专题第十七站，听风观树、闻香识茶，一起品读寒露。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckB8AulQRF54DJgSY3GsOibiaBojqEBRwmq52MENLJ3I3K9Gp0ibCFqe9wa0OVkEyhVAhomk78GJBXJQGdXTrVmUQ73liaVlbkTtDEc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>点击视频，走进华农寒露</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>露染寒秋，草木知时</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>“寒露，九月节。露气寒冷,将凝结也。”作为一年中的第十七个节气，</span></span><span><span>寒露紧邻中秋，提醒着人们岁时已过一大半；这种时光飞逝之感，在今年尤为明显：一过中秋和国庆假期，人们便与寒露迎头相见。</span></span><span><span>“潮汕有句谚语，‘月怕十五，年怕中秋’，意思是每个月过了十五，这个月就很快过完；每年到了中秋节，意味着这一年很快就到年底了。”在林学与风景园林学院教授吴永彬看来，这句谚语虽然带着一丝焦虑，但也不乏催促鼓励之意。</span></span></p><p><span><span>更何况，华农校园里，秋景正徐徐铺开；其中最为应景的，便是栾树与大叶相思。花开正盛的它们，不仅教学科研价值和观赏价值兼具，更见证了一代代华农教师育人初心的绵延传承。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCnl4jAzeuboH4Bia4cS8IiajpSicrDqfEyOY8Dn7veCK5EPuFicyeZUsaSplzcUnqc82Zv9xL6jg7nrmyYQlDw7ttXsIX6HiaJ40SQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDK9kfibibExNkv4oSUN58gIe1IxyJxqpCDeTF0ZG70TLLWrxwad3u8fOjSUncM6xlA7L6h8snydO2UHDQPgiajSvnmrPv5UzzaZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCc36PcFDhBTmic6ic4Im6qsduAeM2rjW9WhLQ2Uvgmrwxa92s1ibgOWAD9NCXPhGZwbO0tD6RRicbLrjnhvIvl3KYunRicEEajZejI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCzee430qxEPk0d6w3euhgMic3l7vwWcicK0KwyKbic9OthjmnO6ia4EAQzC10g1sPLCiadXhwfzqMec5a4jIVXNGfxK0CLULJUtnqo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBAO7MVBrs2VyPNCgCqNN6DlNibiamTLNVX9mtHHYlJe179Ludhib3guZWrF9tib2gbnEOLfpSMIdVicY6122q7D2ib5209YHF8ia66r0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>复羽叶栾树</span></span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCuRvqKHIk4jxp2ZkVQOnEFhsgPLe0libib9eXZHAlIqnymmtZmlWJzibYrQULLWf37FxMicicBNK77icGER8OkuycsiaShzplPoYqqVc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAG2bCcYSicgrJ3JOBgG0lUu8dj846GIObXjYBxbBzqojRV5IibCUErby7NU93Bo5bwcAGDTjbPcBZMfnpuNK3LaQDVFibz3mMkHg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDShLicPLECnL1kcWAtSYyib7ias5P4iawapibZtqSPSJg6rBu2wrfibRPANAHarSI69YCz0dCKxjmLO1lrric1x61swUHDF07vjJlYiac/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCpVK7UMicWMAWtUC6C5V8HMkiamRORkhhCfrFP6cQw86DZJ0nQ3wLHSib6C9rxGcMC29N3E6MczGBHBwUODtNln4vz5e40Sz2Abs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCwvgalM7KxNhc8tx0O0loiaVCDMwiaStNmickQIfHoPYZymazn9e7nc98tGIaGFAM1hYskF9jKsKb1NdnkKqUnhAAQYX5ySJc5vo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBfcxvAHEApsibIXZQhUMYI2LTS3zbEFBlUFTzaqnibKvAZwfaicKUec6libtRsW2RRUoR2bNrMz44IgM56uWVgdDOjWMCEO6icS234/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>栾树的花</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCGqAAQaYqf4VOemfRvVpvg9tXMUlldNo8GKFdmKQEhw2LOWZlByS7UIjHtMmWTdLicibZMAVUu5n6ibhEzkkuwpPZ3E1Kia5Xg79g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBticZa9C34gWTu9RwFPtqPGB875XkP5aMROJyfPibxTKUb71KhAwmkBU8WEw5CE6CVAFiaedVvDOnmymEunJPpO1EHCZt3WYYDto/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAYtb962MSSUhCkiblx1icGnST5F1TPujB3thicDlaIuse1v9XibrtOYs9qE1lTwwib8Smf3G3yCa7ib9C3IA3y6HtawkDETia6wkhcZE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>栾树果实</span></p></section></section><p><span><span>因花期刚好与国庆假期相逢，栾树有着 “国庆花” 的美名。“它</span></span><span><span>具有顶生的圆锥花序，在树冠上呈覆盖之势，因此盛开之时，满目金黄。花落之时纷扬如雨</span></span><span><span>，花后很快就能结出满树橘红色如小灯笼般的果实，是难得的兼备观花赏果的园林树木</span></span><span><span>。”吴永彬介绍，华农校园里有两种栾树，一种是复羽叶栾，位于园艺学院教学实验基地，</span></span><span><span>是2009年由园艺学院副教授郁书君赴台学术交流时采种带回、繁育而成</span></span><span><span>；一种是台湾栾树，位于竹铭草海。</span></span><span><span>二者外形看似相仿，其实细看有不少差别。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>“台湾栾树的小叶基部明显偏斜，先端长渐尖至尾状，花瓣多为五片。</span></span><span><span>相较于台湾栾，复羽叶栾的叶片基部仅略偏斜，先端短尖，花瓣四片。”</span></span><span><span>林学与风景园林学院讲师施诗介绍。</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>更多华农校园植物信息，可关注公众号“</span></span><span><span>华南校园植物”</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckA3WI0giciaTRraTqTevvrCbkicMRHOO6mMUciau1YlGrA5j3tU63n5Ae3C6VGsHPbgysrQjLnLgqB5ZynGtibO7I6HPTwc92icibsNic0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDoz9KjcwHicnlnP8P2JEr0ydbAMCte6UbrhJIiaxejIZdLRmjq8gArxp10ukMp3FZqkUHlaASibia5bu7e8rJACLkiafhOX0cvKX4U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBu5siahzShIW1ELuOb73IybUp6TgvGR6iaxOHnT4vUwfUnJR3ztndia8vDXMYJ6afFnEb78XBxT47WKrbD025SVJ8T70TPrHa7vs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAKoWodkokuqlkOXlSaBg279bicicFuXSeLzeFjBqHY5laYSFwjx2X1oMEuwHDClrtpkn77ZCQyHN1FbhRcuQicUeiczemcEK2phOo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAljuyclQPBw08Iycv4VDh5xuyxbpE9icZXhfvQZKPNsuaUOdSibxPia9AjJSpALJPtsLibj1EKVH6f4VoM9JhibzPsD990431HEg8I/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBKgibdsdcRhrqv2D2BFYyH0WxzcC5TJf5XaeedZLaicfDVDq0tcZ7znqPd5iaSQRwbkQcjLQOkGmWrYFmgO5cNI89mTictbkI25o4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDPSn8Oia9tzH9w921EFJzn9pkWwyDzE4OjLVtp1ltTXp9Bt3MMAAduNm17hwic7BrGGy5uX7CQULXVjlGVSKxgoYWXp5TOaRfa8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>大叶相思</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span>与栾树同期开花的大叶相思，外形更为高大茂盛，在宁荫湖、昭阳湖畔和树木园均有种植。它</span></span><span><span>原产于澳洲及新西兰，具有生长迅速、根瘤菌固氮、落叶量大等优点，也因此被华农专家们看中引入。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“二十世纪七十年代，林学院老先生们把大叶相思作为先锋树种引种到树木园种植，对改良树木园的土壤理化性质发挥了重要的作用，为后来树木园成功引种其他标本树种奠定了坚实的基础，是目前树木园满园葱茏的背后‘功臣’。”吴永彬娓娓道来。</span></span></p><p><span><span>大叶相思的名字也很有趣。它的</span></span><span><span>拉丁学名是Acacia auriculiformis，种加词auriculiformis是一个由拉丁语词根auricula（意为“动物的外耳”）和forma (意为“形状、形态”）组合而成，所以也称耳叶相思。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>露润茶园，秋茗飘香</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>秋寒凝露，滋养茶园。经历夏日的阳光雨露，此时正是岭南秋茶的黄金时期。唐人许浑诗云：“秋茶垂露细，寒菊带霜甘。”得益于昼夜拉大的温差，此时的茶树芽叶内含物质丰富，茶汤香气高扬、滋味醇和，别有一番风味。</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农校内的茶园基地保存着数十份茶树种质资源，一代代茶学师生在这里观察茶树物候，开展品种选育、栽培技术研究，把课堂搬进青翠茶垄之间。采摘秋茶，也是师生们每年的必修课。片片鲜叶经过萎凋、杀青、揉捻、干燥等工序后，将成为一杯杯清香甘润的秋日佳茗。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCbAKiaIv8GIdAku4mqXgwCfRQaDzKTUyiaqwdxG9MMrYZMVMehp7iaVHNAIqgqVibjas5syXUMAnu2PUZRAme03MeLDwso2TNjTq0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBS0J16Be5t70O594jpmYPRkGfq00UCaU3o0S6gnb4M23WqNBITsic9nLwevDICPOpmiasolTmenBuM54ObhJYqxpuhS1DeElGqU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>茶园</span></span></p><p><span><span>这份茶香，不仅萦绕在校园，更飘向了广阔的乡村。9月，潮州市饶平县东山镇的万亩茶园迎来秋茶采摘。驻东山镇科技特派员、华农园艺学院张凌云教授团队穿梭于茶园、车间，指导茶农采茶做茶。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“作为广东科技特派员，我长期扎根东山镇，把实验室的研究成果真正应用到茶叶生产过程中，帮助农户提高种茶制茶的技艺。”张凌云介绍，针对低档茶原料经济效益不高、所制茶类单一等问题，团队创新性地将单丛乌龙茶工艺改良为全发酵单丛红茶工艺，为低档茶原料开辟了新销路。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBLibs5IP3TLKgSxicBlmsOzAjFl7Qev1MvL0ydtiak1IG4SPwmcV7udA5yxm9TBN9UpuUcdlArQcQywCTrOibXibt26Dz6Zx6wj4ko/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckB9v3EJstm9968w1ia72c5jhgsYcC4kuV6IFSzouGMdtN0Rj8G9selXJDmFctAWHw77KEPBJBBNS2TjuaKibcTLibSERBGdMV8lh4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>秋茶</span></span></p><section><p><span>寒露亦是农事管护的紧要时节。此时的岭南大地，晚稻正值抽穗扬花的关键期，北方冷空气开始南下，所谓“寒露风”便来了。温度骤降，空气干燥，正抽穗的稻花容易干枯，造成空秕粒。“禾怕寒露一朝霜”，所以农户们忙着灌水护田，精心管护，竭力守住秋粮丰收的期盼。</span></p></section><section><p><span>风染栾花，露润秋实</span></p><p><span>时序辗转，万物沉淀</span></p><p><span>愿你在清浅寒露之时</span></p><p><span>观秋景，品秋味</span></p><p><span>感知生命的坚韧</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652898561&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ccfc9c449d0efa4084c5478578c79403&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAV2zfT0w8ticrZLRUHRgIFlGoAeQia9vCTicyDSaEStDmmCaibvtGiaBGPxhxjRXFzEcDrojjAVGmIE37U04PxXPbN5ZibImYkSsiadw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>/</span> <span>特别的爱，集体表白！</span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652898098&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4fbd71f6fbe20945438cf0092ff435d0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCIF4k8RdO88RGiasSMDibSliaMNgymIzDC4iaHjdkiahiaNSdnciaTw8jhsDphv19wMbnEgFIWHjmFoMQeJOW2K11OteY7agaic3TFC5U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ 